pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 模块六开场：迁移目标不是"删掉所有按钮只留输入框"，而是复用已有确定性能力；参考架构先简单做，复杂度由需求拉动。
elements:
  - elementId: big-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 90, 300, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 120
      color: "$primaryLight"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "06"
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 268, 700, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: 模块六 · 第八、九部分
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 292, 832, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      color: "$ink"
      bold: true
      text: WebUI 迁移为 Agent 应用与参考架构
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 352, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: parts
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 374, 832, 110]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p><strong>第八部分</strong>　把 WebUI 应用迁移为 Agent 对话式应用：三种架构、UI 元素映射、迁移示例、九步方法</p>
        <p><strong>第九部分</strong>　一版可落地的参考架构：最小可用组件与"先简单做"的优先级</p>
  - elementId: footer-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 518, 500, 12]
    content: {style: "$small", fontSize: 9, text: 模块六 · WebUI 迁移与参考架构}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [850, 518, 50, 12]
    content: {style: "$small", fontSize: 9, align: [right, top], text: "28 / 36"}
